          "text": "Témoignages: LURCY-LEVIS (03) 25.08.2019",
          "text_sha256": "a48359a06baefa7cdbb133bdb19bb4d725cbfe6564adb04d4d1b5e89e1ba742e"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
